      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum for ibuprofen in adults is 3,200 mg/day, so this is twice that.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is also well above the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n\nAt this level the risks of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up a lot. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't make it safe.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, four times daily** (3,200 mg/day). This is the maximum for anti-inflammatory dosing.\n- **1600 mg total per day**, for example 400 mg four times daily or 800 mg twice daily.\n- **400\u2013600 mg every 6\u20138 hours**, for typical analgesic dosing.\n\nTell me the dose you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and give the clinical rationale. I'd suggest checking with pharmacy first, and I can add a note to the order."
      }
